<h1>Wheelhouse</h1>
<p class="lead">
  Wheelhouse keeps track of every bike that comes through the shop, from the moment it's
  tagged at the counter to the moment it goes home.
</p>

<div class="row g-4 mt-3">
  <div class="col-12 col-md-4">
    <h2 class="h5">See what we charge</h2>
    <p>The full price list for every job we do, no need to call and ask.</p>
    <%= link_to "View services", services_path, class: "btn btn-outline-primary" %>
  </div>
  <div class="col-12 col-md-4">
    <h2 class="h5">Bring a bike in</h2>
    <p>Where we are, when we're open, and what happens once you drop it off.</p>
    <%= link_to "Visit the workshop", visit_path, class: "btn btn-outline-primary" %>
  </div>
  <div class="col-12 col-md-4">
    <h2 class="h5">Who runs the shop</h2>
    <p>A small team, three mechanics, and a lot of bikes.</p>
    <%= link_to "About us", about_path, class: "btn btn-outline-primary" %>
  </div>
</div>